{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_039_23_5_02_039_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:1b67210f10f68a1b9fdaa1a1b3f7584f364f4de2f4f6c0679da7a4a40d11637d",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_039_23_5_02_039_23:5_02_039_23:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d392d03e58d34d3c4c637cddbf3244c3f0522385479c6ef68f0a8add014b27ce",
      "text": "哦，师父！辛苦啦！\n你在事务所真是太好啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_039_23_5_02_039_23:5_02_039_23:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ada83147ba07549733fd1b133269b18eb8eadb1711623186e39d4825d081d5b0",
      "text": "道流先生，辛苦了。\n请问有什么事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_039_23_5_02_039_23:5_02_039_23:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccb7383e8a0e0a5b14b5af16003f1f4d045f824507e1ec4560cb4608988059a7",
      "text": "其实我有东西想交给你。\n就是这个……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_039_23_5_02_039_23:5_02_039_23:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9452e34f731fa9bd0951efe8306fc37af85b8cd4b44ddc65d943c01f9c24b0fb",
      "text": "因为是白色情人节嘛，就当作是对前些天的回礼。\n这是我的一点礼物。请收下吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_039_23_5_02_039_23:5_02_039_23:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9efe8cdf342e316892d32bcca5eb3a2e9113ac14f6e1441ef14b21f4a7997fa",
      "text": "原来是这样啊，\n非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_039_23_5_02_039_23:5_02_039_23:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a8ac9adecb787b74a6d46128edde912ad5fc7985d8a3b51f88aac67a0444ff1",
      "text": "在寻找能帮上师父忙的东西时，\n我发现了一条手感超级舒服的毛巾哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_039_23_5_02_039_23:5_02_039_23:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0f45e99289223fb7fbb5988e9632c4c21b0b27b83321591268bafdc66951ad3",
      "text": "我想着要是毛巾的话好用又方便，\n就选了这个啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_039_23_5_02_039_23:5_02_039_23:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2bd435ac32500fe6bae1f313469978cb2be04bc9738c48b4ff6ddda75d81c70f",
      "text": "我看看……这条毛巾，真的超级软乎乎的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_039_23_5_02_039_23:5_02_039_23:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c30109c29ca52188f9362685b4cb12aa98e758f532e9d2abd95d1365a7fe8319",
      "text": "是吧！饱含着平日里的感谢，\n我可是特别讲究地挑出来的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_039_23_5_02_039_23:5_02_039_23:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8fbabd8b42daac01badb2fac9b8d15c5a0e427e64dacc4ead6ae4a0cb24b3e55",
      "text": "再次向您道谢……师父。一直以来非常感谢。\n今后我们几个的事情，也拜托你多多关照了！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
